
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>Student & Parent Resources | St. Martin's High School</title>

    <meta name="description"
          content="Access student and parent resources, academic calendars, syllabus information and school guidelines at St. Martin's High School, Balanagar, Hyderabad.">

    <meta name="theme-color" content="#071A2B">

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">

    <style>
        :root {
            --resources-navy: #071A2B;
            --resources-navy-light: #0C2235;
            --resources-gold: #C5A45A;
            --resources-ivory: #F6F1E7;
            --resources-white: #FFFFFF;
            --resources-text: #253443;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        html {
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            background: var(--resources-ivory);
            color: var(--resources-text);
            font-family: Inter, Arial, sans-serif;
        }

        .resources-page {
            min-height: 70vh;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .resources-hero {
            position: relative;
            padding: 95px 24px 85px;
            color: var(--resources-white);
            background:
                radial-gradient(
                    circle at 85% 20%,
                    rgba(197, 164, 90, 0.15),
                    transparent 35%
                ),
                linear-gradient(
                    135deg,
                    var(--resources-navy),
                    var(--resources-navy-light)
                );
        }

        .resources-hero-inner {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 1120px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .resources-eyebrow {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            color: var(--resources-gold);
            font-size: 0.78rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.2em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .resources-hero h1 {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 0 22px;
            font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", Georgia, serif;
            font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4.5rem);
            font-weight: 600;
            line-height: 1.08;
        }

        .resources-hero h1 span {
            color: var(--resources-gold);
        }

        .resources-hero p {
            max-width: 660px;
            margin: 0;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.78);
            font-size: 1rem;
            line-height: 1.9;
        }

        .resources-gold-rule {
            width: 75px;
            height: 3px;
            margin: 28px 0;
            background: var(--resources-gold);
        }

        .resources-content {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 1120px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 75px 24px 90px;
        }

        .resources-section-heading {
            margin-bottom: 35px;
        }

        .resources-section-heading h2 {
            margin: 0 0 12px;
            color: var(--resources-navy);
            font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", Georgia, serif;
            font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.8rem);
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .resources-section-heading p {
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: 0;
            color: #637080;
            font-size: 0.96rem;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        .resources-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
            gap: 24px;
        }

        .resource-card {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            min-width: 0;
            padding: 30px;
            background: var(--resources-white);
            border: 1px solid rgba(197, 164, 90, 0.28);
            box-shadow: 0 12px 35px rgba(7, 26, 43, 0.045);
            transition:
                transform 0.25s ease,
                box-shadow 0.25s ease,
                border-color 0.25s ease;
        }

        .resource-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            border-color: var(--resources-gold);
            box-shadow: 0 18px 40px rgba(7, 26, 43, 0.09);
        }

        .resource-card-top {
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-start;
            gap: 18px;
            margin-bottom: 22px;
        }

        .resource-icon {
            display: grid;
            flex: 0 0 54px;
            width: 54px;
            height: 54px;
            place-items: center;
            color: var(--resources-gold);
            background: var(--resources-navy);
            font-size: 1.4rem;
        }

        .resource-card h3 {
            margin: 0 0 9px;
            color: var(--resources-navy);
            font-size: 1.12rem;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        .resource-card p {
            margin: 0;
            color: #687585;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        .resource-card-actions {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            margin-top: auto;
            padding-top: 24px;
        }

        .resource-link {
            display: inline-flex;
            min-height: 43px;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 11px 17px;
            color: var(--resources-white);
            background: var(--resources-navy);
            border: 1px solid var(--resources-navy);
            font-size: 0.76rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.07em;
            text-align: center;
            text-decoration: none;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            transition:
                background 0.2s ease,
                color 0.2s ease,
                border-color 0.2s ease;
        }

        .resource-link:hover {
            color: var(--resources-navy);
            background: var(--resources-gold);
            border-color: var(--resources-gold);
        }

        .resource-link-secondary {
            color: var(--resources-navy);
            background: transparent;
            border-color: rgba(7, 26, 43, 0.2);
        }

        .resource-link-secondary:hover {
            color: var(--resources-white);
            background: var(--resources-navy);
            border-color: var(--resources-navy);
        }

        .resources-note {
            margin-top: 36px;
            padding: 23px 26px;
            background: rgba(197, 164, 90, 0.12);
            border-left: 3px solid var(--resources-gold);
        }

        .resources-note h3 {
            margin: 0 0 8px;
            color: var(--resources-navy);
            font-size: 1rem;
        }

        .resources-note p {
            margin: 0;
            color: #596574;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        .resources-contact {
            margin-top: 65px;
            padding: 42px 30px;
            color: var(--resources-white);
            background: var(--resources-navy);
            text-align: center;
        }

        .resources-contact h2 {
            margin: 0 0 12px;
            font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", Georgia, serif;
            font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
        }

        .resources-contact p {
            max-width: 650px;
            margin: 0 auto 24px;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);
            font-size: 0.94rem;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        .resources-contact .resource-link {
            color: var(--resources-navy);
            background: var(--resources-gold);
            border-color: var(--resources-gold);
        }

        .resources-contact .resource-link:hover {
            color: var(--resources-white);
            background: transparent;
            border-color: var(--resources-gold);
        }

        @media (max-width: 700px) {
            .resources-hero {
                padding: 65px 22px;
            }

            .resources-content {
                padding: 52px 18px 65px;
            }

            .resources-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                gap: 18px;
            }

            .resource-card {
                padding: 24px 20px;
            }

            .resources-contact {
                padding: 32px 20px;
            }
        }

        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
            html {
                scroll-behavior: auto;
            }

            .resource-card,
            .resource-link {
                transition: none;
            }

            .resource-card:hover {
                transform: none;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <!-- Shared school header -->
    <%- include('partials/header') %>

    <main class="resources-page">

        <!-- Hero -->
        <section class="resources-hero">
            <div class="resources-hero-inner">

                <span class="resources-eyebrow">
                    Student & Parent Resources
                </span>

                <h1>
                    Everything You Need,
                    <span>In One Place.</span>
                </h1>

                <div class="resources-gold-rule"></div>

                <p>
                    Welcome to the St. Martin's High School Resource Hub.
                    Find important academic information, school guidelines
                    and useful resources for students and parents.
                </p>

            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Resource cards -->
        <section class="resources-content">

            <div class="resources-section-heading">
                <span class="resources-eyebrow">Download Center</span>

                <h2>Student & Parent Resources</h2>

                <p>
                    Access the documents and information you need throughout
                    the academic year. Download links will work when the
                    corresponding documents are added to the school's
                    public resources folder.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="resources-grid">

                <!-- Academic Calendar -->
                <article class="resource-card">
                    <div class="resource-card-top">
                        <div class="resource-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                            &#128197;
                        </div>

                        <div>
                            <h3>Academic Calendar & Syllabus Guide</h3>

                            <p>
                                Important academic dates, school activities,
                                examination schedules and syllabus information.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="resource-card-actions">
                        <a
                            class="resource-link"
                            href="/downloads/academic-calendar.pdf"
                            target="_blank"
                            rel="noopener"
                        >
                            View Calendar
                        </a>

                        <a
                            class="resource-link resource-link-secondary"
                            href="/calendar"
                        >
                            School Calendar
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </article>

                <!-- Parent Handbook -->
                <article class="resource-card">
                    <div class="resource-card-top">
                        <div class="resource-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                            &#128218;
                        </div>

                        <div>
                            <h3>Parent Handbook & Code of Conduct</h3>

                            <p>
                                Review school expectations, student conduct,
                                attendance, discipline and parent responsibilities.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="resource-card-actions">
                        <a
                            class="resource-link"
                            href="/downloads/parent-handbook.pdf"
                            target="_blank"
                            rel="noopener"
                        >
                            View Handbook
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </article>

                <!-- Mandatory Disclosure -->
                <article class="resource-card">
                    <div class="resource-card-top">
                        <div class="resource-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                            &#128196;
                        </div>

                        <div>
                            <h3>Mandatory Disclosure</h3>

                            <p>
                                Find the school's published disclosure
                                information and relevant institutional details.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="resource-card-actions">
                        <a class="resource-link" href="/disclosure">
                            View Disclosure
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </article>

                <!-- Admissions -->
                <article class="resource-card">
                    <div class="resource-card-top">
                        <div class="resource-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                            &#127891;
                        </div>

                        <div>
                            <h3>Admissions Information</h3>

                            <p>
                                Learn about the admission process and review
                                the information available to prospective parents.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="resource-card-actions">
                        <a class="resource-link" href="/admissions">
                            Admission Process
                        </a>

                        <a
                            class="resource-link resource-link-secondary"
                            href="/fee-structure"
                        >
                            Fee Structure
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </article>

            </div>

            <!-- Document notice -->
            <aside class="resources-note">
                <h3>Important information</h3>

                <p>
                    The PDF links above require the actual documents to be
                    placed in the project's
                    <strong>public/downloads</strong> folder. Until those files
                    are added, the PDF links will not open successfully.
                    Please verify document versions and publication approval
                    before making them available to parents.
                </p>
            </aside>

            <!-- Contact -->
            <section class="resources-contact">
                <h2>Need Help Finding a Resource?</h2>

                <p>
                    If you cannot find a document or need assistance with
                    school information, please contact the school.
                </p>

                <a class="resource-link" href="/contact">
                    Contact the School
                </a>
            </section>

        </section>

    </main>

    <!-- Shared school footer -->
    <%- include('partials/footer') %>

    <script src="/js/script.js" defer></script>
    <script src="/js/premium-effects.js" defer></script>

</body>
</html>
